cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MODA, please cite it as below."
title: "MODA: Open-source benchmark and models for fashion search"
abstract: >-
  MODA is an open-source benchmark and model family for fashion retrieval,
  built by Hopit AI. It provides an end-to-end fashion search pipeline
  evaluated component by component on 253,685 purchase-grounded H&M queries
  over 105,542 products, plus released model checkpoints for image-to-image
  retrieval and a zero-added-parameter retrieval system for text-to-image
  retrieval. On LookBench image-to-image retrieval MODA reaches Fine Recall@1
  of 67.68 against a 63.84 Marqo FashionSigLIP baseline. On six public
  text-to-image benchmarks the multi-view retrieval system wins four with
  statistical significance and loses none, at the same parameter count and
  embedding dimension as Marqo FashionSigLIP.
